   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Demining for Peace and Security along the Tajik-Kyrgyz border</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to foster peace, security, and stability in the region. By deploying a gender-balanced and gender-responsive multitask team specialized in Explosive Ordnance Risk Education (EORE) and Explosive Ordnance Disposal (EOD)/Battle Area Clearance (BAC), the project seeks to achieve the alleviation of socio-economic impact of landmines and ERW contamination on women, girls, boys and men along the Tajik-Kyrgyz border</narrative>
